      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PROCLIVITY (4) was strongly fancied last time on the back of a win two back but could only manage second (30.91) at Angle Park. The form from his last run stacks up well. Must come into calculations. CHAOTIC BOY (6) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fifth (20.13) from Box 8 at Angle Park over 342m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. IZZY LETTS (8) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Was a bit beyond her last time when seventh (31.93) over 531m at Gawler in a Grade 5 but is better suited here over less ground. Form at the trip excellent including six wins. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Has ability and is one of the better chances. PAW IKE (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
